    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Begin with 80-GSM bubble wrap for all glassware, electronics, and delicate ceramics. This specific gauge provides optimal cushioning without adding excessive bulk, which is a key factor when you are trying to figure out how to shift furniture at cheap rates, as efficient space utilization directly impacts the final cost.</p>
