    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Construct sturdy shipping containers using corrugated fiberboard sheets that match the weight and dimensions of the contents. For heavier items, double-wall cardboard is essential. This structural support prevents crushing under the weight of other boxes stacked above them.</p>
