    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 03</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Apply edge buffers to all corners of furniture pieces and large appliances. These foam or plastic corner protectors absorb direct impacts that would otherwise chip wood or dent metal surfaces. This step is crucial for maintaining the aesthetic value of your belongings and is a standard practice among trusted operators like shakti home packers and movers banglore who prioritize long-term customer relationships through meticulous care.</p>
